{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "02057",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 1.23,
      "end_seconds": 3.3,
      "duration_seconds": 2.07,
      "text": "Hi, sit anywhere you like."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 7.09,
      "end_seconds": 9.91,
      "duration_seconds": 2.82,
      "text": "Afternoon, is this seat fine?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 11.54,
      "end_seconds": 13.2,
      "duration_seconds": 1.66,
      "text": "what's been worrying you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 14.49,
      "end_seconds": 22.55,
      "duration_seconds": 8.06,
      "text": "Mainly dizziness. There's a couple of other things, but that's the main one."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 27.54,
      "end_seconds": 29.87,
      "duration_seconds": 2.33,
      "text": "Alright, when did this begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 30.84,
      "end_seconds": 46.35,
      "duration_seconds": 15.51,
      "text": "Two months, I think... sorry, six months, I got that wrong. I'm hoping you can tell me something definite. I didn't want to make a fuss, you know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 47.34,
      "end_seconds": 49.76,
      "duration_seconds": 2.42,
      "text": "How often do you get it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 52.84,
      "end_seconds": 56.33,
      "duration_seconds": 3.49,
      "text": "It's a couple of times a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 57.33,
      "end_seconds": 59.49,
      "duration_seconds": 2.16,
      "text": "Any other symptoms with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 60.64,
      "end_seconds": 71.29,
      "duration_seconds": 10.65,
      "text": "A headache goes along with it, most of the time. I mean, you know, the headache? That's been for two days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 72.87,
      "end_seconds": 76.04,
      "duration_seconds": 3.17,
      "text": "What do you take on a normal day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 78.09,
      "end_seconds": 94.98,
      "duration_seconds": 16.89,
      "text": "Right, uh, it's furosemide, 40 milligrams, every morning for the fluid. I do miss it now and then, to be fair. Sodium valproate, twice a day for the fits."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 98.87,
      "end_seconds": 101.22,
      "duration_seconds": 2.35,
      "text": "Do you know the dose?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 103.05,
      "end_seconds": 104.08,
      "duration_seconds": 1.03,
      "text": "500 milligrams."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 109.1,
      "end_seconds": 111.63,
      "duration_seconds": 2.53,
      "text": "Do you have any chronic illnesses?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 112.96,
      "end_seconds": 129.76,
      "duration_seconds": 16.8,
      "text": "I mean, yes, heart failure. My family kept telling me to get it checked. It's a relief to finally sit down and talk about it. I have epilepsy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 131.19,
      "end_seconds": 132.62,
      "duration_seconds": 1.43,
      "text": "So, anything else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 133.22,
      "end_seconds": 142.97,
      "duration_seconds": 9.75,
      "text": "Right, so heart failure is already on your record. We'll keep that in mind today. What operations have you had, if any?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 143.92,
      "end_seconds": 162.83,
      "duration_seconds": 18.91,
      "text": "just a mole taken off my arm, a few years ago i'd rather not end up on lots of tablets if I can avoid it i did try to ignore it for a while"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 164.64,
      "end_seconds": 167.42,
      "duration_seconds": 2.78,
      "text": "Now some background about your lifestyle."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 168.45,
      "end_seconds": 183.52,
      "duration_seconds": 15.07,
      "text": "I do a yoga class on Thursdays. I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day. I look after my grandchildren most days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 194.56,
      "end_seconds": 200.35,
      "duration_seconds": 5.79,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any chest pain, fever or rash?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 202.05,
      "end_seconds": 206.54,
      "duration_seconds": 4.49,
      "text": "no, no chest pain, fever or rash"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 207.88,
      "end_seconds": 211.83,
      "duration_seconds": 3.95,
      "text": "how about your heart, any problems like that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 212.58,
      "end_seconds": 217.08,
      "duration_seconds": 4.5,
      "text": "okay, so no, nothing with my heart"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 219.02,
      "end_seconds": 223.11,
      "duration_seconds": 4.09,
      "text": "Let me get the readings out of the way."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 229.21,
      "end_seconds": 231.73,
      "duration_seconds": 2.52,
      "text": "So, sit still for a moment..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 245.62,
      "end_seconds": 251.38,
      "duration_seconds": 5.76,
      "text": "Okay: pulse is 67 beats a minute, respiratory rate 18, pressure 116 over 74."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 253.9,
      "end_seconds": 257.75,
      "duration_seconds": 3.85,
      "text": "alright, over here please and I'll take a look"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 258.72,
      "end_seconds": 261.42,
      "duration_seconds": 2.7,
      "text": "I'll listen to your chest now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 277.28,
      "end_seconds": 285.37,
      "duration_seconds": 8.09,
      "text": "Your lips are pink but the whole household feels unwell, and the oxygen reading looks normal but cannot be trusted."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 288.32,
      "end_seconds": 290.58,
      "duration_seconds": 2.26,
      "text": "That's the the examination finished."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 299.87,
      "end_seconds": 305.74,
      "duration_seconds": 5.87,
      "text": "Right, here's what I'm thinking. It points towards possible carbon monoxide poisoning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 306.97,
      "end_seconds": 308.45,
      "duration_seconds": 1.48,
      "text": "Is this permanent?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 309.82,
      "end_seconds": 325.63,
      "duration_seconds": 15.81,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like possible carbon monoxide poisoning. Stop me if I've got anything wrong. You've had dizziness for six months, and no chest pain or rash."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 327.38,
      "end_seconds": 330.08,
      "duration_seconds": 2.7,
      "text": "mm, um, that's right"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 330.86,
      "end_seconds": 335.79,
      "duration_seconds": 4.93,
      "text": "Let's get you seen by the emergency team, I'll arrange the letter."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 336.67,
      "end_seconds": 338.4,
      "duration_seconds": 1.73,
      "text": "Alright, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 344.03,
      "end_seconds": 347.46,
      "duration_seconds": 3.43,
      "text": "Anything else on your mind before you go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 349.04,
      "end_seconds": 350.93,
      "duration_seconds": 1.89,
      "text": "that's clear, thanks"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 352.14,
      "end_seconds": 353.33,
      "duration_seconds": 1.19,
      "text": "See you soon."
    }
  ]
}